    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Keeping the camp awake",
      "text": [
        "When the beat is **8 or more** (half of 16), each collection also wakes every totem within 8 blocks and keeps it answered. Only the beat matters here; how full the collector is does not. See [Keeping](keeping)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Tuning it",
      "text": [
        "Sneak-use a Ley Lens on the collector to print the exact breakdown, factor by factor. Ley sight draws the ropes that pass near you, so you can stand in one before you build.",
        "A redstone signal pauses it.",
        "Ranking it in Echo Attune, then Bind, then Manifest adds **15% Pulse a beat** per rank, not the workshop 118%.",
        "If it seems weak, crouch and right-click it with this book."
      ]
    },
